For example, if the input string is "racecar", the function should return "racecar" because it is a palindrome. If the input string is "level", the function should return "level" because it is a palindrome. If the input string is "hello", the function should return an empty string because there are no palindromes in the string.

You can use any programming language you like to solve this exercise. However, you must provide a complete solution with all necessary imports and declarations. You do not need to provide any additional libraries or dependencies beyond what is already available in your chosen language.

